<title>UK: Halifax tender gets 733p per share.</title>
<headline>Halifax tender gets 733p per share.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British banking giant Halifax Plc said on Wednesday it received an average price of 733p per share when it sold 6.14 million shares in a tender for members on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Halifax has organised a number of tenders since its flotation early this month. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
